  "releaseNotes": "v1.5.25: Performance, Stability & FrameOverlay — Added YUV-level text burn-in (FrameOverlay) via ServerConfiguration.BackCameraOverlaySlots / FrontCameraOverlaySlots; BT.601 limited-range color conversion, drop-shadow, configurable anchor, font size, color, and alpha; H.264 only, per-frame hot path ~2µs. Fixed simultaneous-connect race: replaced volatile bool _isStreaming with Interlocked.CompareExchange on int flag so CameraStartRequested and StreamingStateChanged(true) each fire exactly once regardless of concurrent SETUP requests. Replaced Thread.Sleep in FramePacer with SpinWait for sub-millisecond precision. Added per-CameraId Channel caching in EncoderManager to avoid repeated allocation on reconnect. Selective buffer zeroing: only pad bytes written to encoder input buffer rather than zeroing the full stride-aligned region. Narrowed fan-out lock in RtpPacketBuilder to cover only the client list snapshot, not the entire send loop. Removed unreachable dead-code paths in StreamingController. Build: replaced all CA1416 Build.VERSION guards with OperatingSystem.IsAndroidVersionAtLeast(); removed stale XML doc param tags (CS1572); fixed CS8603 null-forgiving on cached encoder field; removed unused dropped-frame counters (CS0169); pinned Xamarin.AndroidX.Collection.Ktx 1.5.0.1 to silence NU1608; rewrote Transforms/Metadata.xml removing ~30 stale rules that produced BG8A00 noise.",
